Subject: [PATCH] Fix Package D-E missing overflow surcharge note and max-pax
 cap

- Package D-E (26-30 pax) was missing the '+P500/head for over 30 pax'
  note that Package C already had, and had no maximum headcount cap
  shown.
- Added a per-villa maxPax field since Villas 1-3 and Villas 4-5 share
  rate-tier arrays but have different real capacities (34/40/50 and
  40/34 respectively), so the cap now reflects each villa correctly
  instead of being hardcoded.
- Added a tierNote() helper that appends the correct max pax to the
  D-E note wherever it's rendered (RatesSection toggle view and the
  VillaModal Standard Rates table).
- Fixed a latent bug in VillaModal's Standard Rates table that
  referenced an undefined 'tier' variable instead of 'pkg', which
  would have thrown at runtime.
